@startuml
title P1 Telegram / History / Presence - Final Ownership Handoff

left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Telegram user" as Telegram
actor "App client" as App

rectangle "STORY-260712-34kbkn owns" {
  [Telegram adapter\nattachments + opaque callbacks] as Adapter
  [Inline route adapter\ndefault + replacement command] as Inline
  [Shared presentation\nsemantic key + EN + RU] as Labels
  [History projection + commands] as History
  [Presence / DND / block surface] as Presence
}

rectangle "Canonical upstream owners" {
  [Identity / ActorContext] as Identity
  [SubmitMedia / lifecycle] as Media
  [Transmission resolver / scheduler] as Tx
  [Moderation evidence] as Moderation
}

rectangle "Downstream consumers" {
  [Windows / macOS UI] as UI
  [Overlay / interrupt mixer] as Mixer
  [Store compliance] as Store
  [Phase 2 Air / targets / tracks] as P2
}

Telegram --> Adapter
App --> History
App --> Presence
Adapter --> Identity : re-resolve every action
Adapter --> Media : untrusted attachment hints
Adapter --> Inline
Inline --> Tx : common create / cancel
History --> Tx : projection / fresh replay
History --> Media : owner delete
History --> Moderation : exact-target report
Presence --> Tx : canonical DND / block policy
Adapter --> Labels
History --> Labels
Presence --> Labels

Labels --> UI
History --> UI
Presence --> UI
Tx --> Mixer : capability-gated commands
Labels --> Store
History --> P2 : versioned extension only

note bottom
  No raw Telegram authorization, second media/scheduler/policy domain,
  Phase 2 track/offline inbox semantics or inferred manual evidence.
end note

@enduml
